The partnership is helping to test new approaches and develop solutions to some of the most pressing health challenges facing communities.

[Working together to improve care in communities facing the biggest health challenges](https://arc-nenc.nihr.ac.uk/news/working-together-deep-end-primary-care/)

## Funded by

- NENC Integrated Care System
- NIHR Applied Research Collaboration
- NIHR School for Public Health Research, Primary Care Research & Social Care Research
- NIHR Research Delivery Network
- NIHR Patient Safety Collaboration
- NIHR Health Service Delivery Research programme

